      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like if enabled the single and/or the span variant with `std::has_unique_object_representations` we should be okay. From it\u0027s description: \n\n\"This trait was introduced to make it possible to determine whether a type can be correctly hashed by hashing its object representation as a byte array.\"",
